          "Investigate and directly address the persuadable 4-5% that explains the gap between 62% and the expected 70%+ result in an affluent, homeowner-dominant district — whether that gap is driven by fiscal frustration, specific governance failures, healthcare anxiety, or economic concern about younger adult opportunity, identify it and answer it.",
