          "Do not allow minority communities—3.98% Asian, 2.25% Hispanic, 2.06% Black—to become invisible in a district where the dominant story is the affluent white professional majority; these communities have real concerns around housing affordability, healthcare equity, and educational access that deserve specific constituent attention and policy response."
