          "Emphasize vocational and skilled-trades pathways, not college access; the 76.6% non-college-educated majority needs to see alignment between education messaging and workforce reality.",
          "Build a property-owner coalition around property tax stability and home-value protection; at $63,551 median income, household budgets are tight enough that assessments matter, and this is the core of electoral loyalty."
