          "Lead on school funding and education quality as the primary local governance issue: with a median age of 34.8 and 18.4% college attainment, this is a district where families with school-age children are a core constituency, and specific advocacy for adequate state education funding is the most concrete way to differentiate from a generic incumbent narrative.",
          "Conduct genuine constituent outreach to understand why no credible challenger emerged in 2024: whether this reflects actual satisfaction, opponent recruitment challenges, or low electoral salience is strategically decisive for anticipating whether a strong challenger in 2026 could mobilize against the incumbent."
