          "Mobilize high turnout among the 78% white, college-educated, homeowner-majority base — this constituency has the civic participation infrastructure and economic capacity to volunteer, donate, and turn out at scale; a Democratic campaign that activates these resources can defend the 58% margin.",
          "Avoid any rhetoric that dismisses or condescends to the 42% Republican opposition — in an affluent, educated district, a Republican minority is likely composed of small-business owners, finance professionals, and policy-focused voters whose concerns about regulatory burden or tax efficiency deserve respectful engagement rather than partisan dismissal."
