          "Do not campaign this seat as though 63% is an immobile foundation: in Pennsylvania's current political environment, affluent, educated, older homeowners are actively evaluating both parties' offers on education funding, healthcare, and tax fairness; a representative who treats consolidation of the existing margin as optional will find the margin eroding."
