          "Use unopposed status to build deep constituent infrastructure now: without a challenger forcing engagement, the opportunity exists to establish recurring town halls, constituent service protocols, and legislative agenda-setting around renter economic security and healthcare access — infrastructure that makes the seat genuinely uncontestable in future cycles.",
