          "Engage the 43% college-educated constituency on policy substance and implementation track record; this segment evaluates candidates on demonstrated competence and specific solutions, not partisan messaging — a State Senate candidate must be able to speak with fluency about the education funding formula, housing policy levers, and tax structure issues that affect their daily lives.",
