          "Engage the 15.51% Black community and 7.43% Hispanic community with specific constituent attention on economic mobility, healthcare access, and representation in local decision-making; in a 68.94% white district, minority communities can become invisible in campaign messaging despite being essential to Democratic electoral performance.",
          "Address the cost-of-living concerns for renters and younger professionals: at 25.6% rental rate and $104,305 median income, a substantial portion of this district is priced into the housing market at the edge of affordability; housing supply, zoning flexibility, and cost-of-living policy are material concerns for constituency retention and growth."
