          "Monitor for Republican recruitment of a credible suburban professional candidate who can compete for educated voters on fiscal responsibility without conceding on education or environment — the current 59% is durable only if Democrats maintain that alignment.",
          "Do not assume the 59% is a floor; at 48.2% college education and $118,861 income, this constituency evaluates on competence and delivery, not inherited loyalty — consistent constituent service and visible impact on district priorities is the ongoing requirement for holding this seat."
