          "Lead with homeowner and renter economic security in tandem: at 45.2 median age, 79% homeownership (implied by 25.1% renter rate), and $63,697 income, the constituency is asset-holding but income-constrained. Property tax fairness, healthcare cost management for older adults, and wages sufficient for renters to transition to homeownership are the material governance concerns that distinguish a durable incumbent from a vulnerable one.",
