          "Avoid complacency around the 64% margin: a two-to-one Republican advantage in a suburban district is solid but not insurmountable; if the incumbent takes the constituency for granted or fails to deliver on suburban quality-of-life expectations, a well-positioned challenger can erode the margin significantly in a single cycle."
