          "Address college-educated voter realignment directly: the 50.1% college-educated rate and 56% Democratic margin reflect a cohort that has moved away from Republican positioning on institutional competence and healthcare stability — not a permanent Democratic base. Demonstrate how your agenda serves their material interests in stable institutions, quality schools, and effective governance; do not assume their loyalty is unconditional.",
